Sarengrad is the second-largest city in [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] and one of the more populous in [[Geography/Althane/The Occident|the Occident]]. It stands in a crescent, its center given to the government and its far side to a great permanent encampment where the country's draftees serve out their two years. The streets are lined with the warming lamps common to Oresk, and the older buildings are painted in bright colours. The poorer, more crowded outskirts are where the [[Org/Althane/Golden Sparrows|Golden Sparrows]] have their strength.

[[People/Althane/Karkov|Karkov]] lived in the city until his death, and the Sparrows keep their headquarters here. The [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] runs its city operations from a building in the north, near a well once blamed for the [[Phenomena/Althane/Wasting Fever|wasting fever]].
